    "description": "Office Depot\nFelt-Tip Porous Pens, 12-Count (Lot of 4 Packs)\nAssorted Color Porous Point Pens\n10\" x 9\" x 2\"\nFactory Sealed New in Packaging\nThis professional lot features four factory-sealed retail packs of Office Depot brand felt-tip porous pens. Each pack contains 12 vibrant, assorted colors designed for precision and clarity. These marker-style pens utilize a medium 1.0mm point to deliver smooth, consistent strokes with quick-drying ink that effectively resists smearing. The varied color palette is perfect for office organization, color-coding, and creative illustration projects.\nTotal quantity of 48 pens across four individual 12-count retail blister packs\nPalette includes black, blue, green, lilac, magenta, navy, orange, plum, purple, red, turquoise, and yellow\nQuick-drying, smear-resistant ink formula with durable 1.0mm medium nib\nCondition:\nExcellent, brand new condition. All four blister packs are original and factory sealed with no signs of tampering. The cardstock backing remains clean and structurally sound with only minimal shelf wear consistent with retail storage.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
